{"id":1418,"title":"局部变量","summary":"Local Variables","tags":"","components":[{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"5f7fd910-1650-3075-9044-1f36675df6c2","knowledge_id":19,"title":"局部变量介绍","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":19,"title":"局部变量介绍","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"849a6941-2c06-3138-b8cf-d02c7387efc9","title":"","title_html":"","text":"让我们从一个例子开始。\n\n**你能猜出这个程序的输出结果吗？**","text_html":"<p>让我们从一个例子开始。</p>\n<p><strong>你能猜出这个程序的输出结果吗？</strong></p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"9d4eb7c6-50ab-30aa-bc82-e03724cb1e4e","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"def add_numbers(n1, n2):\n    result = n1 + n2\n    print(result)\n\nadd_numbers(2, 5)","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"8782f246-9a94-31a2-afae-a3adcb51f159","title":"","title_html":"","text":"很简单吧？输出结果将是 **7**。\n\n现在，我们不在函数内部打印 `result` 变量，而是在函数调用后打印 `result` 会怎样？","text_html":"<p>很简单吧？输出结果将是 <strong>7</strong>。</p>\n<p>现在，我们不在函数内部打印 <code>result</code> 变量，而是在函数调用后打印 <code>result</code> 会怎样？</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"80dfac5d-0604-3062-9cbb-3bc1cc5141d4","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"def add_numbers(n1, n2):\n    result = n1 + n2\n\nadd_numbers(2, 5)\nprint(result)\n\n# Error: name 'result' not defined","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"5cd3a6f5-ce81-34ad-ae89-5de8a00cd531","title":"","title_html":"","text":"如果运行该程序，会得到一个错误信息：提示`result` 变量未定义。\n\n这就是局部变量概念发挥作用的地方。","text_html":"<p>如果运行该程序，会得到一个错误信息：提示<code>result</code> 变量未定义。</p>\n<p>这就是局部变量概念发挥作用的地方。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":4}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"cba80bb9-c195-3604-8fc5-3046f71843e1","knowledge_id":20,"title":"局部变量","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":1,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":20,"title":"局部变量","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"287f3fea-d880-309b-a79c-6428773ff74d","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在函数内部定义的任何变量都是该函数的局部变量。例如：","text_html":"<p>在函数内部定义的任何变量都是该函数的局部变量。例如：</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"b97e5dcc-1075-37a7-8492-48c692f989ab","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"def add_numbers(n1, n2):\n    # n1、n2、result 都是局部变量\n    result = n1 + n2\n\nadd_numbers(2, 5)\nprint(result)","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"ac800749-4967-3291-886e-bc715d8b513b","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在这里，当 `add_numbers()` 函数执行结束时，它内部的所有变量：`n1`、`n2` 和 `result` 都会被**销毁**。\n\n上述程序抛出错误的原因是 Python 认为`result`变量没有定义。\n\n如果你还记得，我们可以通过使用 `return` 语句来解决这个问题。","text_html":"<p>在这里，当 <code>add_numbers()</code> 函数执行结束时，它内部的所有变量：<code>n1</code>、<code>n2</code> 和 <code>result</code> 都会被<strong>销毁</strong>。</p>\n<p>上述程序抛出错误的原因是 Python 认为<code>result</code>变量没有定义。</p>\n<p>如果你还记得，我们可以通过使用 <code>return</code> 语句来解决这个问题。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"fd825f03-251c-310b-8b27-69479ffe87f8","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"def add_numbers(n1, n2):\n    result = n1 + n2\n    return result\n\noutput = add_numbers(2, 5)\nprint(output)","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"00a2d34e-c29b-31f5-ac77-2aa3e7d0bb90","title":"","title_html":"","text":"通过使用 `return` 语句，我们并没有直接使用局部变量。而是将其值返回给调用函数，并赋值了变量`output`。\n\n接下来，我们将了解局部变量这一概念的重要性。","text_html":"<p>通过使用 <code>return</code> 语句，我们并没有直接使用局部变量。而是将其值返回给调用函数，并赋值了变量<code>output</code>。</p>\n<p>接下来，我们将了解局部变量这一概念的重要性。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":4}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f0a035c4-cf9c-3a8f-af3e-8f886add025b","knowledge_id":21,"title":"局部变量为何重要？","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":2,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":21,"title":"局部变量为何重要？","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"78f748b9-bb4b-3eae-b7e6-32408f6bdbf5","title":"","title_html":"","text":"局部变量之所以重要，是因为它们使**函数具有独立性**。\n\n正如之前所讨论的，函数内部有什么以及使用了哪些变量并不重要；只要我们知道两件事，就可以使用该函数：\n\n1. 函数使用的参数\n2. 函数的返回值\n\n**示例代码**","text_html":"<p>局部变量之所以重要，是因为它们使<strong>函数具有独立性</strong>。</p>\n<p>正如之前所讨论的，函数内部有什么以及使用了哪些变量并不重要；只要我们知道两件事，就可以使用该函数：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>函数使用的参数</li>\n<li>函数的返回值</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>示例代码</strong></p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"03de2210-a906-3277-b6ac-306a0b713300","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"def add_numbers(n1, n2):\n    result = n1 + n2\n    return result\n\nn1 = 2\nn2 = 5\nresult = add_numbers(n1, n2)\nprint(result)    # 7","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"2559d546-6299-388f-bb47-f80ca6254f8a","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在程序中，重要的是要理解函数内部的 `n1`、`n2` 和 `result` 变量是 `add_numbers()` 函数的局部变量。\n\n它们不同于函数外部的 `n1`、`n2` 和 `result` 变量（尽管它们的名称相同）。\n\n也可以使用不同的变量名来编写。上面的程序等同于下面的程序：","text_html":"<p>在程序中，重要的是要理解函数内部的 <code>n1</code>、<code>n2</code> 和 <code>result</code> 变量是 <code>add_numbers()</code> 函数的局部变量。</p>\n<p>它们不同于函数外部的 <code>n1</code>、<code>n2</code> 和 <code>result</code> 变量（尽管它们的名称相同）。</p>\n<p>也可以使用不同的变量名来编写。上面的程序等同于下面的程序：</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"76f91412-333c-3068-9d37-8bdb42ab34f1","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"def add_numbers(n1, n2):\n    result = n1 + n2\n    return result\n\nnum1 = 2\nnum2 = 5\nresult = add_numbers(num1, num2)\nprint(result)    # 7","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":3}]}},{"type":"QuestionRef","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"8b00301d-6748-339e-8f84-b9f12ee0c0cb","title":"局部变量","question_id":3144,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":3,"resolved":{"question_id":3144,"title":"局部变量","description":"","description_en":"","knowledges":[],"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"下面代码的输出结果是什么？\n\n```python\ndef greet():\n    greeting = 'Hello'\n\nprint(greeting)\n```","question_text_html":"<p>下面代码的输出结果是什么？</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python3\">def greet():\n    greeting = &#x27;Hello&#x27;\n\nprint(greeting)\n</code></pre>\n","question_options":[{"id":11001,"key":"A","text":"Hello","text_html":"<p>Hello</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"`print()`函数中的 `greeting` 变量未定义。请记住，`greeting = 'Hello'`仅是`greet()`函数的局部变量。它不存在于外部。","md_html":"<p><code>print()</code>函数中的 <code>greeting</code> 变量未定义。请记住，<code>greeting = &#x27;Hello&#x27;</code>仅是<code>greet()</code>函数的局部变量。它不存在于外部。</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11002,"key":"B","text":"运行报错","text_html":"<p>运行报错</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"没有定义 `greeting` 变量。它只存在于 `greeting()` 函数内部。","md_html":"<p>没有定义 <code>greeting</code> 变量。它只存在于 <code>greeting()</code> 函数内部。</p>\n"},"correct":true,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11003,"key":"C","text":"greeting","text_html":"<p>greeting</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"我们打印的是 `greeting` 变量，而不是 `'greeting'` 字符串。","md_html":"<p>我们打印的是 <code>greeting</code> 变量，而不是 <code>&#x27;greeting&#x27;</code> 字符串。</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11004,"key":"D","text":"其他选项都是错误的","text_html":"<p>其他选项都是错误的</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"其中一个选项是正确的","md_html":"<p>其中一个选项是正确的</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}}],"user_answers":null,"is_right":null}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"57b42413-7351-3454-94e2-11122aff9c56","knowledge_id":22,"title":"使用前定义函数","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":4,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":22,"title":"使用前定义函数","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"9c0a87cf-4111-3735-bcc6-728e4f4ac69c","title":"","title_html":"","text":"你能猜出这段代码有什么问题吗？","text_html":"<p>你能猜出这段代码有什么问题吗？</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"017866da-9466-3775-96c7-00a0b0d49354","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"# 函数调用\ngreet()\n\n# 函数定义\ndef greet():\n    print('Hello')","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a8d40a16-5c1a-3ba2-8d00-17af3b763a46","title":"","title_html":"","text":"**输出**\n\n```text\nNameError: name 'greet' is not defined\n```\n\n在这里，Python 认为第 2 行中的 `greet()` 引发了错误。这是因为我们此时还没有定义 `greet()` 函数。","text_html":"<p><strong>输出</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">NameError: name &#x27;greet&#x27; is not defined\n</code></pre>\n<p>在这里，Python 认为第 2 行中的 <code>greet()</code> 引发了错误。这是因为我们此时还没有定义 <code>greet()</code> 函数。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Note","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"94fad262-bf3a-3e54-9cf2-5dd0413329f3","text":"如果你正在编写一个程序，请将所有函数放在文件的开头。这样，当你调用函数时，它们已经被定义了。","text_html":"<p>如果你正在编写一个程序，请将所有函数放在文件的开头。这样，当你调用函数时，它们已经被定义了。</p>"},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"3f532dec-db22-33fa-a4a9-f78a8ca1e9c9","title":"","title_html":"","text":"至此，我们已基本掌握了函数的所有基础知识。\n接下来，我们将编写一些实用程序，帮助我们正确定义及调用函数。","text_html":"<p>至此，我们已基本掌握了函数的所有基础知识。\n接下来，我们将编写一些实用程序，帮助我们正确定义及调用函数。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":4}]}}],"status":"undo","course_no":"026","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/026/page/1418"}
